Package: localhome
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: LocalHome <localhome@localhost>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: mosquitto, avahi-daemon, libnss-mdns, systemd
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Description: LocalHome - local climate control for the Arduino UNO Q
 The two-zone radiant climate, the VMC, the dehumidifier and the Shellys
 that drive them, from a web page on the LAN. Compiled with Nuitka: the
 program and everything it needs in /opt/localhome, no Python to install;
 configuration and history in /var/lib/localhome. Installs and updates the
 same way: apt install ./localhome_<version>_arm64.deb
